#!name=自动加入TestFlight
#!desc=自动监控TestFlight名额，一旦有新的名额即刻加入。
#!author=奶思[https://github.com/fmz200], DecoAri[https://github.com/DecoAri], xream[https://github.com/xream]
#!homepage=https://hub.kelee.one
#!icon=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/TestFlight.png
#!category=定时任务
#!arguments=CaptureAccountToken:false,RunTask:false,RunMonitor:true,TaskCron:0 0/2 * * * ?,TaskMonitor:0 * * * * ?,policy:PROXY
#!arguments-desc=[CaptureAccountToken] 捕获账号令牌 / [RunTask] 自动加入TF / [RunMonitor] 监控TF位置 / [TaskCron] 加入TF定时参数 / [TaskMonitor] 监控TF定时参数 / [policy] 策略

[Rule]
DOMAIN, testflight.apple.com,{{{policy}}}

[Script]
Auto_Join_TF · 获取账号令牌 = type=http-request, pattern=(?i)^https?:\/\/testflight\.apple\.com\/v3\/accounts\/.*\/apps$, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yjwj205/surge-modules/main/kelee/scripts/JavaScript/TestFlight/CaptureAccountToken.js
Auto_Join_TF · 自动加入TF = type=cron, cronexp="{{{TaskCron}}}", script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yjwj205/surge-modules/main/kelee/scripts/JavaScript/TestFlight/AutoJoinTF.js, timeout=600
Auto_Join_TF · 监控TF位置 = type=cron, cronexp="{{{TaskMonitor}}}", script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yjwj205/surge-modules/main/kelee/scripts/JavaScript/TestFlight/AutoMonitorTF.js, timeout=30
